## Research Question 1
Research Question:
Do rural fatal crashes involve more fatalities per crash than urban fatal crashes?

### Plot 1: Number of Fatal Crashes by Rural vs Urban
```{r}
accident_small |>
  filter(RUR_URBNAME %in% c("Rural", "Urban")) |>
  ggplot(aes(x = RUR_URBNAME)) +
  geom_bar(fill = "steelblue") +
  labs(title = "Number of Fatal Crashes in Rural and Urban Areas",x = "Area Type",y = "Number of Fatal Crashes") +
  theme_minimal(base_size = 14)
```
##Urban areas had more fatal crashes than rural areas in this dataset. This figure provides an overview of where fatal crashes occurred before examining differences in crash severity and other characteristics.



