```
### Plot 2b: Distribution of Fatal Crashes by Hour
```{r}
accident_weekend |>
  filter(HOUR >= 0, HOUR <= 23) |>
  count(weekend, HOUR) |>
  group_by(weekend) |>
  mutate(
    proportion = n / sum(n)
  ) |>
  ggplot(aes(
    x = HOUR,
    y = proportion,
    color = weekend
  )) +
  geom_line(linewidth = 1) +
  geom_point() +
  labs(
    title = "Hourly Distribution of Fatal Crashes",
    subtitle = "Proportion of crashes within weekdays and weekends",
